"""Diagnostics.

A) Does the Lorentzian classifier carry ANY forward directional information?
   Measured directly on the raw prediction, independent of any trade plan:
   accuracy and AUC of `pred` against the realised move over H bars.
B) Split stability + placebos for the one configuration that looked alive
   (5m, wide stop).
