           stop = entry -/+ max(1.2*ATR24, 5); target vwap or 1.5R; cells z {2.0, 2.5}.
    BREAK  (any regime, squeeze precondition): first-hour width in bottom-25% of
           trailing 20d dist, close beyond first-hour range -> go with break; stop
           opposite range edge (floor 5); cells: exit {EOD, 2R}.
    TAKEOUT(any regime): poke beyond prior-day H/L by <= 0.5*ATR24 then close back
           inside by >= 1pt -> fade; stop beyond sweep extreme (floor 5);
           cells: target {2R, prior-day mid} x fresh {off, on}. Fresh = skip levels
           already traded through overnight (ETH extremes between RTH sessions).
           [PREREG-V2, added pre-data 2026-07-07 from user hypothesis after live
           chart observation; counted in N.]
  Cells: TREND 2 + MR 2 + BREAK 2 + TAKEOUT 4 = 10 + routed ENSEMBLE
  (built from train-selected variants) = 11.
  Split 70/30 by days. Selection per book on train net R/trade. Holdout ONCE.
  Gates (event-level): per-trade HAC-t>=2 (L=2), DSR>=0.95 @ N=11, sign-flip MCPT
  (1000) p<0.05, >=20 trades. Ensemble also reported vs +0.15R/trade bar.
