The screenshots show 1, 2 and 5 contracts on different trades — the size is
solved from the stop distance so every trade risks the same amount.
With avgR positive, that is what converts expectancy into money.

contracts = round(risk_$ / (stop_pts * $2 per MNQ point)), minimum 1.
