"""
f6_momo-continuation.py  --  FAMILY: intraday momentum / trend continuation on NQ / MNQ.

Independent build (does not import or share state with any other fam_*.py in this dir).

Sub-families
  DON : Donchian breakout, lookback N minutes  (close through prior-N-bar extreme)
  TSM : time-series momentum, c[t]-c[t-N] > k * ATR
  PBK : pullback-to-EMA continuation inside an established intraday trend
  each optionally gated by a REACTIVE opening-drive trend-day detector (OD gate)

Exits: fixed-R target, ATR chandelier trail, Donchian trail, breakeven move, time stop,
       hard flatten at 16:59 ET (Apex).

Splits  IS   = NQ 2023-01-01 .. 2024-12-31
        OOS1 = NQ 2025-01-01 ..
        OOS2 = MNQ (all, 2026)

Costs   NQ  pv=20 comm $4.00 RT  slip 0.25 pt adverse
        MNQ pv=2  comm $1.50 RT  slip 0.25 pt adverse
        Slippage charged on ENTRY and on every STOP-TYPE exit (initial stop, trail stop,
        breakeven stop) and on the 16:59 market flatten and time-stop (both market orders).
        Targets are limit fills -> no slippage. This is the conservative reading.

Fills   entry at NEXT bar open after the signal bar closes.  Stop-before-target inside a bar.

ALL features are built here from o/h/l/c only, and every one is verified by a TRUNCATION
audit (recompute on df[:t+1], compare last value to the full-run value).  No column of the
parquet other than o,h,l,c,v,daycycle is used for signal generation.

Usage: python3 f6_momo-continuation.py <stage>
  stages: audit | mfe | sweep | oos | placebo | all
"""
