"""
FAMILY: momo-continuation  (intraday momentum / trend continuation on NQ / MNQ)

Sub-families tested
  D  : Donchian channel breakout, multiple lookbacks (1-min close through prior N-bar extreme)
  P  : pullback-to-moving-average continuation on 5m / 15m bars in an established intraday trend
  T  : time-series momentum (last N minutes up by k x ATR -> buy)
  *  : each optionally gated by an OPENING-DRIVE trend-day detector

Exits: fixed R multiple, ATR (chandelier) trail, Donchian trail, breakeven-move, time stop, and
hard flatten at 16:59 ET.

Splits    IS = NQ 2023-01-01..2024-12-31 ; OOS1 = NQ 2025 ; OOS2 = MNQ 2026 (all)
Costs     NQ  pv=20 comm $4.00 RT  slip 0.25pt adverse on ENTRY and on STOP-type exits
          MNQ pv=2  comm $1.50 RT  same
Fills     entry at NEXT bar open after the signal bar closes; stop-before-target inside a bar.

Usage:  python3 fam_momo-continuation.py <stage>
        stages: selftest | mfe | sweepD | sweepP | sweepT | sweepG | final
"""
import sys, os, json, math, itertools, warnings
