volume profile (POC/VAH/VAL), session VWAP + sigma bands, 4 session VWAPs, EM envelope, Kalman,
calibrated HOD/LOD fan position, opening-range position, wick shape, volume climax, CVD
divergence, participation decay, range consumed, time. Take only the TOP slice ~1/day.
